@@text `development/creativeCommon/build/libs/creativecommon-1.2.0.jar`; both must be in the scratch `mods/`) and the
@@text `soil_yield.js` / `botany_pots.js` / `tooltips.js` of that day. Probe: copy `tools/soil_yield_probe/sy_probe.js` as
@@text `kubejs/server_scripts/zz_sy_probe.js`. Fresh config (all switches `true`). Group A; place each soil with `/setblock`,
@@text the plant above it in its ripe state (block-state syntax), then `/syt roll` (break) or `/syt pick` (own pick), 400+ each.
