@@table
## SQ-SY-14 | boot lines: Fortune strip on 70+ tables, 36 crops, nether soils, no "no base", PickSoilYieldMixin applied
@group A
@commands Boot. `grep "\[soil-yield\]" logs/latest.log`
@pass `Fortune stripped: N terms on M crop tables` with M at least 70; `35 crops (...)` naming `sweet_berry`, `lemon`, `nether_wart`, `crimson_fungus_colony`; soils list `rich soul soil +33%, fertile soul soil +66%`; no `no base in soil_yield.json`; no mixin apply error for `PickSoilYieldMixin` (a failed `require = 1` stops the boot)
@fails Boot stops on a mixin: the target class or `m_49840_` call changed (crop_yields.md 4); `no base`: `soil_yield.json` missing from the jar
@from batches/r1115/p6_a1.qb
bootexpect \[soil-yield\] Fortune stripped: \d+ terms on ([7-9]\d|\d{3,}) crop tables
bootexpect \[soil-yield\] 36 crops \(.*sweet_berry.*\)
bootexpect \[soil-yield\] 36 crops \(.*lemon.*\)
bootexpect \[soil-yield\] 36 crops \(.*nether_wart.*\)
bootexpect \[soil-yield\] 36 crops \(.*crimson_fungus_colony.*\)
bootexpect rich soul soil \+33%, fertile soul soil \+66%
bootreject no base in soil_yield\.json
bootreject PickSoilYieldMixin.*(fail|error|Error|could not)
bootreject Mixin apply.*SoilYield
shell grep -h "\[soil-yield\]\|\[botany_pots\]" logs/latest.log logs/kubejs/server.log | cut -c1-1500 | sort -u
shell grep -ic "PickSoilYield" logs/latest.log; grep -i "mixin" logs/latest.log | grep -i "creativedelight" | grep -iE "error|fail|warn" | head -5
look shell lines: soils list and crop list as the pass text

## SQ-SY-15 | (rerun 2, Fortune half) Fortune III rolls equal the no-tool means
@group A
@commands Ripe wheat, carrots, sweet potato on farmland / Rich Farmland / Fertile Soil: `/syt roll X Y Z 600 none`, then the same with `minecraft:diamond_hoe{Enchantments:[{id:"minecraft:fortune",lvl:3}]}`
@pass Wheat 1.00 / 1.33 / 1.66, carrots 3.71 / 4.87 / 6.02, sweet potato 2.71 / 3.54 / 4.36 (within 0.1; ripe sweet potato is `age=5`, its max); the Fortune III means match the no-tool means (wheat seeds 2.71 both)
@fails Fortune higher: table not in `fortune_free` or the strip missed a nested function; base off: `soil_yield.json`
@from batches/r1115/p6_a6.qb
> setblock 1000 -60 1000 minecraft:wheat[age=7]
> setblock 1002 -60 1000 minecraft:wheat[age=7]
> setblock 1004 -60 1000 minecraft:wheat[age=7]
> setblock 1006 -60 1000 minecraft:carrots[age=7]
> setblock 1008 -60 1000 minecraft:carrots[age=7]
> setblock 1010 -60 1000 minecraft:carrots[age=7]
> setblock 1012 -60 1000 veggiesdelight:sweet_potato_crop[age=5]
> setblock 1014 -60 1000 veggiesdelight:sweet_potato_crop[age=5]
> setblock 1016 -60 1000 veggiesdelight:sweet_potato_crop[age=5]
> syt roll 1000 -60 1000 600 minecraft:diamond_hoe@fortune=3
> syt roll 1002 -60 1000 600 minecraft:diamond_hoe@fortune=3
> syt roll 1004 -60 1000 600 minecraft:diamond_hoe@fortune=3
> syt roll 1006 -60 1000 600 minecraft:diamond_hoe@fortune=3
> syt roll 1008 -60 1000 600 minecraft:diamond_hoe@fortune=3
> syt roll 1010 -60 1000 600 minecraft:diamond_hoe@fortune=3
> syt roll 1012 -60 1000 600 minecraft:diamond_hoe@fortune=3
> syt roll 1014 -60 1000 600 minecraft:diamond_hoe@fortune=3
> syt roll 1016 -60 1000 600 minecraft:diamond_hoe@fortune=3
count \[syt\] roll .* nbt .*fortune.* n 600: == 9
reject \[syt\] error
look wheat 1.00 / 1.33 / 1.66 (seeds about 2.71), carrots 3.71 / 4.87 / 6.02, sweet potato 2.71 / 3.54 / 4.36 with F3

## SQ-SY-16 | (rerun 2, Fortune half) Fortune III picks equal the no-tool picks
@group A
@commands Own picks over farmland / Fertile Soil: ripe `vintagedelight:cucumber_crop[age=7]`, `vintagedelight:ghost_pepper_crop[age=7]` (over Soul Soil / Nulch), `veggiesdelight:zucchini_crop[age=7]`: `/syt pick X Y Z 400 none`. Tomato: Fertile Soil, `farmersdelight:tomatoes[age=3]` bottom vine, a rope above with `farmersdelight:tomatoes[age=3,ropelogged=true]`; pick the rope vine; then with a Fortune III hoe
@pass Cucumber 1.50 / 2.49, zucchini 1.50 / 2.49, ghost pepper 1.00 / 1.66, rope vine tomato 2.49 (rotten tomato about 0.05, not raised); the plant goes back to stage 5 (cucumber, ghost pepper) or 0 (vine); Fortune changes nothing
@fails Pick unchanged: mixin not applied (check `-Dmixin.debug.export`), or the block id lacks a `picks` row; rope vine at 1.50: walk list in `soil_yield.json`
@from batches/r1115/p6_a6.qb
> setblock 1002 -60 1004 vintagedelight:cucumber_crop[age=7]
> setblock 1006 -60 1004 veggiesdelight:zucchini_crop[age=7]
> setblock 1010 -60 1004 vintagedelight:ghost_pepper_crop[age=7]
> setblock 1012 -59 1004 farmersdelight:tomatoes[age=3,ropelogged=true]
> syt pick 1002 -60 1004 400 minecraft:diamond_hoe@fortune=3
> syt pick 1006 -60 1004 400 minecraft:diamond_hoe@fortune=3
> syt pick 1010 -60 1004 400 minecraft:diamond_hoe@fortune=3
> syt pick 1012 -59 1004 400 minecraft:diamond_hoe@fortune=3
> kill @e[type=minecraft:item]
count \[syt\] pick .* n 400: == 4
reject \[syt\] error
look cucumber 2.49, zucchini 2.49, ghost pepper 1.66, rope tomato 2.49 with F3

