## SQ-SY-21 | (rerun) pots filled with /syt potset: required 8000 Fertile, 8727 Rich Farmland, 9600 dirt; growth counts up
@group A
@commands `/kubejs dump_recipes` or JEI-free check: `grep "\[botany_pots\]" logs/latest.log`; place a botany pot with Fertile Soil and wheat seeds
@pass `3 soils set (Rich x1.1, Fertile x1.2)`; a wheat pot on Fertile Soil completes in about 8000 ticks (9600 / 1.2), on Rich Farmland about 8727 (9600 / 1.1)
